# LOCAL BRING-UP CONVENIENCE -- DO NOT UPSTREAM.
#
# Lets the host drive dmesg/modprobe/etc over ssh without an interactive TTY,
# which is most of what debugging this device consists of. postmarketOS puts the
# main user in `wheel`, so key off the group rather than a hardcoded username.
#
# Only defensible because this is a bring-up device reachable solely over USB.
# Drop this file before the device package goes anywhere near pmaports proper.
%wheel ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
